				<r3d:description language="eng">The CLARIAH-HiTZ is a repository that specializes in delivering language resources and technology mainly for the Basque language and Studies and also for the other official languages of Spain. It offers access to data and tools related to these areas on a sustainable basis and provides guidance to both users and developers. The repository provides sustainable long-term access to diverse linguistic resources including textual corpora, linguistically annotated corpora, lexical databases, dictionaries, natural language processing tools, Large Language Models and Digital Humanities applications.</r3d:description>
